### Get Sensors

GET http://localhost:3001/api/v1/sensors

###

### Create Sensor

POST http://localhost:3001/api/v1/sensors
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "uuid": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
    "room_id": 1,
    "device_id": 1,
    "channel": 1,
    "code": "TEMP-01",
    "name": "Temperature Sensor",
    "sensor_type": "temperature",
    "unit": "°C",
    "min_value": 2,
    "max_value": 8,
    "alarm_low": 2,
    "alarm_high": 8,
    "enabled": 1
}

###

### Get Sensors

GET http://localhost:3001/api/v1/sensors